OL,3,GNEWSACommunity campaign to buy 19th
OL,4,ACentury church hits funding target
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners bidding to keep a 19th
OL,7,FCentury church in the south of Scotland
OL,8,Ffrom falling into private hands have
OL,9,Fhit their funding target.
OL,11,FThe Friends of Wamphray Church (FWC)
OL,12,Fplan to buy the building near Beattock
OL,13,Ffor the community after raising
OL,14,F#45,000.
OL,16,FDonations have come in from across the
OL,17,FUK, the United States and Canada to
OL,18,Fback the campaign launched in January.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
