OL,3,GNEWSACommunity campaign to buy 19th
OL,4,ACentury church hits funding target
OL,5,
OL,6,FOnce the purchase from the Church of
OL,7,FScotland is finalised it is hoped the
OL,8,Fsite can be used as a venue for
OL,9,Fweddings, concerts and other events -
OL,10,Fhowever FWC said more money would need
OL,11,Fto be raised to progress with their
OL,12,Fplans.
